<title>FINLAND: KESKI-SUOMEN PUHELIN 1996 PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>KESKI-SUOMEN PUHELIN 1996 PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    14.7 vs 5.0</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		     nil vs N/A</p>
<p> Turnover					   146.1 vs 123.7</p>
<p> Operating profit				  15.4 vs 5.8</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (pct)		  55.9 vs 43.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish regional telecoms operator is</p>
<p>Keski-Suomen Puhelin Oy. The company said in its result</p>
<p>statement that it expected turnover to increase by about 10</p>
<p>percent this year.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
